<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 6,559 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  200   (141 and 220)</p>
<p>    Good		130   (128 and 155)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     118   (118 and 128)</p>
<p>    Medium	    112   (112 and  90)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 98   ( 95 and  78)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 200 pence for an Assam PD.</p>
</text>
